## Lab Overview

In this hands-on lab, you will use Copilot in Microsoft Planner to create and manage a project plan for a new product launch initiative. You will generate tasks, milestones, dependencies, goals, timelines, and stakeholder communications using natural language prompts. These capabilities help leaders coordinate cross-functional teams, improve project visibility, and accelerate project planning and execution.


